5 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw 153% of normal in April to May and 68% in July to August. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 42% of normal, and grid 22990 had its driest year in 1987 at 61%.</p>"}
